    "source": "Original Aurisar layout. A cold moor plateau reached through Zone 1's northern pass; differentiated from Zone 1 by heightfield, biome weights and scatter density only — it reuses Zone 1's eight terrain layers and its one shared TerrainLit material (D159).",
